请对以下 case 进行三维加权评分。

=== case_id ===
Case-29-elderly-care-002

=== 用户原始指令 (query.txt) ===
文字压在背景图上的那种,点进系统操作,能读天气,要红色危险提示

=== TaskSpec 契约 (task.taskSpec.json) ===
{
  "userQuery": "文字压在背景图上的那种,点进系统操作,能读天气,要红色危险提示",
  "size": "2x2",
  "eventCandidates": [
    {
      "call": "clickToIntent",
      "args": {
        "intentName": "SetSettingSwitch",
        "params": {
          "appBundleName": "com.huawei.hmos.settings",
          "itemName": "battery_saving_mode",
          "switchFlag": 0
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "dataModelSchema": {
    "data": {
      "weather": {
        "location": {
          "districtName": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "天气查询地区名称",
            "sampleValue": "朝阳"
          }
        },
        "current": {
          "temperatureText": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前温度展示文本",
            "sampleValue": "35°C"
          },
          "condition": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前天气现象",
            "sampleValue": "雷阵雨"
          },
          "alertLevel": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "当前天气预警信息",
            "sampleValue": "高温红色预警"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "assetCandidates": [
    {
      "src": "resources/base/media/icon_weather1.png",
      "description": "亲人关怀场景的天气雨伞图标，可作为天气看护卡片的背景视觉锚点。"
    }
  ]
}

=== 待评审 DSL (card.dsl.jsonl，共 3 行) ===
